#   NANODA_NAT_CMP_MIN=13 NANODA_BLE_CENSUS=1 …                 # the census that decides
#
# `cfg.json` is `good/init-prelude.ndjson`, `nat_extension` and
# `string_extension` on, `num_threads: 1`, `unsafe_permit_all_axioms`.
#
# WHAT IT ANSWERS. The brief for task #127 link 3 was that `⟦Nat.ble a b⟧ =
# ⟦Bool.true⟧` need not be transferred schematically at `x, y ∈ ω`, because the
# corpus holds only 55 concrete instances at operands ≤ 12, each provable by
# concrete δ and ι "which the checker already does at every conversion check".
# This asks that at the one site where the answer matters — `reduce_rec`, at the
# major premise of the ι redex — rather than building it.
