#     workaround; and every one of the 25 424 β contractions is CONDITIONAL on
#     1–4 `⟦arg⟧ ∈ ⟦binder domain⟧ ` premises nothing discharges.
#
# Ledger, `NANODA_NAT_CMP_MIN=13` alone: 11 969 / 2 639 / 172 561 against a
